; Lead Hunter v3: 6-point build (CPU_SPEED 2, FIRE_RATE 2, ENGINE_SIZE 1, FUEL_CAPACITY 1).
; Flies at 39 m/s around the arena centre at about 85 m, always turning the same way.
; Sweeps the radar in 5-degree steps and locks the first robot it finds. Each tick it fixes
; that robot by scanning an 11-scan window across the radar cone, averaging its own position
; and the range over the detections, and takes velocity from the last tick's movement.
; It fires at the predicted impact point when the gun is ready and the fix is at most
; 12 ticks old. It flees robots detected within 45 m and escapes after 4 ticks without moving.
CPU_SPEED 2
FIRE_RATE 2
ENGINE_SIZE 1
FUEL_CAPACITY 1

DEFINE MARGIN 45
DEFINE XHI 336
DEFINE YHI 268
DEFINE MINFIRE 16
DEFINE MAXFIRE 400
DEFINE GATE 25
DEFINE VGAIN 1
DEFINE LOSETIME 25
DEFINE FRESH 12
DEFINE ORBITR 110
